        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Bezzer Quizzer</strong> is a trivia game that blends knowledge with action. It’s not about getting every question exactly right; instead, you’ll need a solid general knowledge across all kinds of topics, whether about weight, length, or age. Knowing it all isn’t required, but hey, it wouldn’t hurt! Questions are presented as cards that you must arrange in the correct order. Successfully placing 10 cards wins the round and unlocks the more action-packed mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the answering player is busy sorting their cards, use that time to collect valuable coins, sometimes by fighting your way to the golden nuggets. These coins can turn the tide of the game or simply buy you that stylish hat you’ve always wanted. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Bezzer Quizzer</strong> is a trivia game that blends knowledge with action. It’s not about getting every question exactly right; instead, you’ll need a solid general knowledge across all kinds of topics, whether about weight, length, or age. Knowing it all isn’t required, but hey, it wouldn’t hurt! Questions are presented as cards that you must arrange in the correct order. Successfully placing 10 cards wins the round and unlocks the more action-packed mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the answering player is busy sorting their cards, use that time to collect valuable coins, sometimes by fighting your way to the golden nuggets. These coins can turn the tide of the game or simply buy you that stylish hat you’ve always wanted. </p>",
